    "season after blending; blending mellows flavour (1 source)",
    "cool before blending to avoid scald (2 sources)",
    "do not boil once cream is added (1 source)",
    "vegetable stock keeps it vegetarian; two sources default to or allow chicken stock",
    "coconut cream swap makes it dairy-free/vegan (2 sources)",
